abstract: >-
  A convention for carrying a population of biological cells in an OpenUSD
  stage as a PointInstancer with per-instance primvars, including a Cell
  Ontology / NCI Thesaurus term per cell for interoperability with
  single-cell atlases. Adds no prim types; any OpenUSD tool reads it. An
  optional codeless API schema (BioCellAPI) declares the primvars to tools
  that load its plugin, and a validator checks conformance.
keywords:
  - OpenUSD
  - Cell Ontology
  - multicellular simulation
  - visualization
  - digital twin
